*.cred

# NEVER commit real QQ data: the pulled encrypted database or any decoded output.
# These are DATA (declared in .dataclass.json) and belong only in the private companion config.
qq_db_pull/
qq_export/
qq_json/
qq_organized/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
# but the data-boundary manifest and plugin/skill metadata must stay tracked
!.dataclass.json
!.claude-plugin/plugin.json
!skills/**/*.json
